00:11:50,521 --> 00:11:52,185
因为你一直在我身边
'cause you're always with me--

372
00:11:53,291 --> 00:11:54,591
在我的脑海里
in my thoughts,

373
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:56,000
我的梦里
my dreams...

374
00:11:57,260 --> 00:11:58,220
我的心里
my heart.

375
00:11:58,900 --> 00:12:01,800
我值得我用尽所有的能力去爱你
You deserve more than I could possibly ever give you,

376
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,560
可你就是我的全部
but everything I have is yours.

377
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:08,120
我爱你
I love you.

378
00:12:10,014 --> 00:12:10,947
停
Cut!

379
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,300
太美了
That was beautiful.

380
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,180
我真的感觉到了
I really felt that one.

381
00:12:14,180 --> 00:12:14,740
你感觉到了吗
Did you feel that one?

382
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:16,560
我什么都没感觉到
No, I didn't feel anything.

383
00:12:16,660 --> 00:12:17,420
我在问安迪
I was talking to Andy.

384
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:19,460
我知道 放我下来 变态
I know! Put me down, freak!

385
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:24,980
真让我怀念啦啦队的日子
That really takes me back to my cheerleading days.

386
00:12:29,860 --> 00:12:31,420
一个承受着那么多痛苦的人
How could a guy with so much pain

387
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:32,620
是如何创作出这么充满希望的作品的
create such hopeful imagery?

388
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:34,200
要是我妈患上肺病晚期
I certainly couldn't paint like that

389
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,760
我可画不出来这样的作品
if my mother was dying of consumption.

390
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,240
她上次感冒
The last time she had a cold,

391
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:39,340
我连茶几的花都摆不好
I could barely arrange the flowers on the front table.

392
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,740
你知道我觉得什么最有意思吗
You know what I found so interesting?

393
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:42,560
是第一幅画和最后一幅
Was that the first painting and the last painting

394
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:43,400
简直太像了
were so similar,

395
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,860
我认为那是有意图的
and I think that that was intentional,

396
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:47,360
是对永恒人生的诠释
a comment on the perpetual motion of life.

397
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:49,080
第一幅就是最后一幅
The first painting was the last painting.

398
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,100
我们走了一圈
We walked in a circle.

399
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:51,800
你确定吗
Are you sure?

400
00:12:53,157 --> 00:12:54,770
我要去找小卡
So...you know, I'm gonna go check on Cam

401
00:12:54,770 --> 00:12:56,897
他一个人呆了很久了
because he's been alone f-for quite some time.

402
00:12:56,897 --> 00:12:58,048
他可能在摸哪幅画呢
And, you know, he's probably touching a painting.

403
00:12:58,048 --> 00:12:59,600
别 别走啊
N-no, don't go!

404
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,920
我们正聊得高兴呢
We're having such a good time.

405
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,545
就剩我们两个了
I guess it's just you and me now.

406
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,400
小卡走了没什么
It was okay when Cam left

407
00:13:05,408 --> 00:13:06,860
我还有米奇尔这个笨蛋垫底
and passed the dunce cap to Mitchell,

408
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:07,720
可他走了的话
but with him gone,

409
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,859
就轮到我了
it went to me.

410
00:13:09,398 --> 00:13:11,452
要是卢克在就好了
What I would've given to have Luke there.

411
00:13:11,554 --> 00:13:12,723
卢克啊
Ah, Luke.

412
00:13:12,733 --> 00:13:15,032
又可人又够蠢
Sweet as custard and just as smart.

413
00:13:16,140 --> 00:13:17,020
搞定了
And presto.

414
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:18,960
太感谢了 邓菲先生
Thank you so much, Mr. Dunphy.

415
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:21,080
真不知道怎么感谢你
I wish I could repay you somehow.

416
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,820
别客气 下次见到你女朋友
Nah. Next time you're with your girlfriend,

417
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:23,640
想着我就好
just think of me.

418
00:13:23,900 --> 00:13:24,300
没问题
Done.

419
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:26,140
走了
Later.

420
00:13:26,540 --> 00:13:27,160
那是谁啊
Who's that?

421
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,520
我的约会对象
My date.

422
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:30,620
你约的午饭吗 这都5点了
Your lunch date? It's 5:00.

423
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:31,680
他睡过了
He fell asleep.

424
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:33,280
可他一睡醒就给我发短信了
But he texted me right when he woke up.

425
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:35,200
你觉得他休息够了吗
Well, then, you'd think he'd be well-rested enough

426
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,040
他连过来敲门的力气都没有
to walk to the front door.

427
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,340
男人鸣笛来鼓舞士气
Yeah, a gentleman honks to support the troops,

428
00:13:38,340 --> 00:13:39,460
可不是召唤女朋友
not summon his girlfriend.

429
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,300
虽然我女朋友就是军人
Although my girlfriend is a troop,

430
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:42,560
所以对我来说 两者有点分不清
so in my case, it's a little confusing.

431
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,460
天呐 真唠叨
Oh, my god, it's still talking.

432
00:13:44,620 --> 00:13:46,420
因为他知道你没有受到尊重
Because it knows you're not being respected.

433
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:47,403
-谢谢 -别客气
- Thank you. - You bet.

434
00:13:47,403 --> 00:13:49,860
你们不懂真实世界里的
Ugh. You guys don't understand how dating works

435
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:50,700
约会是怎样的
in the real world.

436
00:13:50,900 --> 00:13:52,160
你说什么呢
What are you talking about?

437
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:54,440
看看安迪今天为贝丝做的一切
Look at everything Andy did for Beth today.

438
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,320
我活着就是为了让她高兴
I just live my life to make her happy.

439
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,180
我要去把这个交给邮差
I'm gonna give this to the mailman

440
00:13:58,180 --> 00:13:59,500
他会把它给海岸警卫队
who's gonna give it to the coast guard,

441
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:00,852
明天这个时候
and by this time tomorrow,

442
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,680
海岸警卫队的某个人
someone in the coast guard's

443
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,960
会把它交给我女朋友
gonna be giving it to my girlfriend.

444
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,320
能想象她看到这个时
Can you imagine the smile on her face

445
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,360
挂在脸上的笑容吗
when she takes it all in?

446
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:11,120
我要走了 你俩好好回味吧
Okay, I'm gonna go while you two replay that in your minds.

447
00:14:12,100 --> 00:14:13,300
天呐
Oh, my gosh.

448
00:14:14,743 --> 00:14:17,000
你想重演《地心引力》吗
Would you like to re-enact "Gravity"?

449
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:17,620
好啊 我演桑德拉·布洛克
Yes. Sandra Bullock!

450
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,280
该死
Dang it!

451
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:21,040
不错 抢得够快
Good call. That was quick.

452
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:27,320
我等了你一个下午就这待遇吗
That's what I get after I waited for you all afternoon?

453
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,380
你真美
Uh...you look good?

454
00:14:29,580 --> 00:14:30,680
这我知道
I know that.

455
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:32,700
你几个小时前就该来接我了
You were supposed to pick me up hours ago.

456
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:35,140
你可是我醒了以后 第一个
You were, like, the first or second person

457
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:36,340
或第二个发短信的人
I texted after I woke up.

458
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:38,914
真感人
Aww! That's so sweet.

459
00:14:38,914 --> 00:14:41,598
你想没想过要走到门前去敲门啊
Did it even occur to you who comes to the door?

460
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:42,780
还要走到门前
Comes to the door?

461
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:44,080
做个绅士
A gentleman.

462
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:46,720
你可以至少帮我开下车门吗
Could you at least open the car door for me?

463
00:14:49,460 --> 00:14:50,580
我们能走了吗
Now can we go?

464
00:14:51,140 --> 00:14:51,960
够了
You know what?

465
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,260
去再睡一觉吧
Go take another nap.

466
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,500
我宁可等一个
I'd rather wait for someone

467
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:55,780
愿意为我穿越风雪
who'd walk through a blizzard for me

468
00:14:55,780 --> 00:14:57,520
而且鸣笛只为了鼓舞士气的人
and only honks to support the troops!

469
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,800
我没明白你的意思
I don't understand you.

470
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:00,940
我也不明白
Neither do i!

471
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:08,860
克莱尔 你太美了
Claire, you look beautiful.

472
00:15:08,980 --> 00:15:10,000
你真闪耀
You're glowing.

473
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:10,860
我不闪耀
I'm not glowing.

474
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:11,540
我是在冒汗
I'm sweating.

475
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:12,660
拜托
Come on.

476
00:15:13,340 --> 00:15:15,140
看着镜子里的自己
Look at yourself in the mirror.

477
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:20,240
别告诉我你没有感到高贵而特别
Don't tell me that you don't feel gorgeous and special.

478
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:23,160
你说得对
You're right.

479
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,320
我在发光
I am radiant.

480
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:28,040
我就好像是
Oh, it's like I'm in a...

481
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,100
在童话或者梦里
in a fairy tale or a dream.

482
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:32,840
说谎
Lies!

483
00:15:33,860 --> 00:15:34,840
你是装出来的
You're faking it.

484
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,246
抱歉
Well, I'm sorry!

485
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:37,480
想想是谁把我养大的
Look who raised me.

486
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,440
我是我爸的女儿
I am my father's daughter...

487
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,280
还兼任半个儿子
and also kind of his son.

488
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,320
那件衬衫不是买给卢克的
And I lied about that being Luke's shirt.

489
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:45,660
我给自己买了三种颜色的
I bought it for myself in three colors.

490
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:47,920
我就是想配合你而已 歌洛莉亚
I am trying to help you out here, Gloria,

491
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,460
可这不是我
But this just isn't me.

492
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,060
你确实帮了我
You did help me.

493
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,260
真庆幸我没有女儿
I am glad I didn't have daughters.

494
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:55,900
至少我带曼尼逛街时
You know, at least when I take Manny shopping,

495
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,240
我们一天都会很愉快
we make a day of it.

496
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,493
我都不用让他转动身体
I don't even have to ask him to twirl

497
00:15:58,501 --> 00:15:59,881
因为他会主动转起来
because he just does it.

498
00:15:59,881 --> 00:16:01,067
走了 莉莉
Vamos, Lily!

499
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:02,040
莉莉
Lily?

500
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:06,160
-莉莉 -莉莉
- Lily? - Lily?

501
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,160
她是不是 没有
Is she-- no.

502
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,478
没有吗 她走了 她走了
No? She's gone. She's gone.

503
00:16:09,478 --> 00:16:09,990
-莉莉 -等等 等等
- Lily! - Wait. Wait.

504
00:16:09,990 --> 00:16:11,640
莉莉 莉莉 莉莉
Lily! Lily! Lily! Lily!

505
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:12,900
别走 裙子
No, the dress!

506
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:14,800
-莉莉 -莉莉
- Lily? - Lily?

507
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,520
等等 等等 等等
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

508
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,520
我穿高跟鞋跑不动
I can't run in these shoes!

509
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:22,040
现在你想穿男孩子的鞋了吧
I bet you wish you had boy shoes now, huh?

510
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:22,640
莉莉
Lily?

511
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:25,740
-克莱尔 等一下 -怎么了
- Claire, stop! - What?

512
00:16:26,045 --> 00:16:27,819
-看 -我的天
- Look! - Oh, my god.

513
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:32,860
好的 跑 跑起来 快点
Okay, run, run. Come on. Come on!

514
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:38,680
她看起来好开心
She looks so happy.

515
00:16:38,820 --> 00:16:39,480
是啊
She does.

516
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:41,040
她真的好开心
Oh, she really does.

517
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,180
他们一定会杀了我们
They're gonna kill us.

518
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:45,500
什么样的公主
What sort of princess?

519
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:48,420
就是那个和野兽跳舞
The kind that dances with beasts

520
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:49,380
不嫁给加斯顿的美女
and won't marry Gaston.

521
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:50,620
-真的吗 -怎么了
- Really? - What?

522
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:52,000
她只喜欢这一件
It's the only dress she likes.

523
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:54,500
莉莉想在婚礼上打扮成贝尔
Lily wants to come to the wedding as Belle.

524
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:55,500
也说得通
Makes sense.

525
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:57,891
她在胡娇的家宴上穿成了小探险家多拉
She went to Pepper's Seder as Dora the explorer.

526
00:16:59,234 --> 00:17:00,472
好吧
I-it's fine.

527
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:01,580
你确定吗
Are you sure?

528
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:02,780
是的 没事
Yes. Yes.

529
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:04,940
只要她开心就好
A-As long as she's happy.

530
00:17:04,940 --> 00:17:06,780
在男同性恋婚礼上阻止别人成为
A gay wedding is hardly the place to stop someone

531
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:07,980
她想成为的样子确实不太合适
from being who they want to be.

532
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,880
他们说可以
They said it's fine.

533
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,980
我终于开心啦
Yay! I'm finally happy!

534
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:15,360
怎么了
What?

535
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:17,620
我看到你转动身体了
I saw you twirl.

536
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:18,740
我才没有
Oh, I did not.

537
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:20,080
你有
Yes, you did.

538
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:21,800
多漂亮的小姑娘啊
Such a pretty girl.

539
00:17:22,460 --> 00:17:23,100
闭嘴
Shut up.

540
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:24,140
你才是姑娘
You're a girl.

541
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,620
我们的女儿怎么样了
How about that daughter of ours?

542
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,500
她跟着自己的心情走了吧
She marches to the beat of her own drum, huh?

543
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:29,380
是啊
Yeah. Exactly.

544
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:30,899
所以 为什么我们要那么在意
S-so, why are we so concerned

545
00:17:30,899 --> 00:17:33,220
两个书呆子怎么看我们
what two nerdy teenagers think of us?

546
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:34,480
真正的大智慧
Isn't the true mark of intelligence

547
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,040
不就是承认自己不知道什么吗
being able to admit what you don't know?

548
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:36,800
小声点 曼尼过来了
Shh. Here comes Manny.

549
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:37,840
天哪 他没听到我说的吧
Oh, my god. Did he hear me?

550
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:38,540
伙计们
Hey, guys.

551
00:17:38,540 --> 00:17:39,440
没什么
Nothin'.

552
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,800
你来这里干什么
Hey, what are you doing out here?

553
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,960
是你们两个今天邀请我们来的
You guys invited us so we could spend the day together.

554
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:44,800
但你们在这里
It felt wrong that you two are out here

555
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:46,500
只有我和艾丽克斯在里面怪怪的
and I was in there all alone with Alex.

556
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:47,180
跟不上她的节奏了 对吧
Couldn't keep up, could you?

557
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:48,040
她什么都知道
She knows everything.

558
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,140
她把一个讲解员都弄哭了
She made a docent cry.

559
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:50,760
没关系 我们也是假装懂的
It's okay. We're faking it, too.

560
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:51,560
是吧
Well, duh.

561
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,660
你们在这里啊
There you guys are.

562
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:53,378
没什么
Nothin'.

563
00:17:53,378 --> 00:17:55,120
我们正要回去呢
Uh, we were just headed back in.

564
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:56,440
是啊 我们就在外面透透气
Yeah, I'm getting a second wind.

565
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,660
不 不 没关系
Oh, no, no, no. That's okay.

566
00:17:57,660 --> 00:17:59,580
不如我们去找点东西吃吧
Uh, what do you say we go check out some food trucks?

567
00:17:59,900 --> 00:17:59,980
真的吗
Really?

568
00:18:00,460 --> 00:18:01,700
如果你们很想进去我也可以
I'll go back in if you guys want,

569
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:02,960
但我真的很饿
but I'm actually really hungry.

570
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,849
-随你便 -你说了算
- Yeah, whatever you want. - Okay, well, whatever you need,

571
00:18:04,849 --> 00:18:06,357
好吧 谢谢你们
Yeah.Thanks, guys.

572
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:08,880
要我说实话
If I'm being honest,

573
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,020
我必须得出来了
I had to get out of there.

574
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:13,160
我在那装了一整天傻真是太累了
I was exhausted from having to dumb it down all day.

575
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,820
真的吗 脖子
Really? The neck?

576
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:17,760
是啊 脖子上一吻 什么门都能开
Yeah, a kiss on the neck opens all kinds of doors.

577
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:18,780
最后一个
Last one.

578
00:18:22,300 --> 00:18:23,320
干得好 小冠军
Great job, champ.

579
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:25,220
谁说你什么都做不出来的
Who said you can't build anything?

580
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:27,400
我爸爸 警察 医生
My dad, the police, a doctor.

581
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,240
你有天分
You got a gift.

582
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:29,720
相信我 学点工科
Trust me. Take shop.

583
00:18:30,115 --> 00:18:31,565
我想我会的
I think I'm gonna.

584
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:34,040
你怎么会知道这么多事情呢
Hey, how'd you get to know so much about everything?

585
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:35,520
大多是我爸爸教我的
From my dad, mostly.

586
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:36,460
他教我如何用电钻
He taught me how to use a drill,

587
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:37,260
如何换轮胎
change a tire,

588
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,840
如何在兄弟叫你帮忙搬家的时候装病
fake an injury when a buddy asks you to help him move.

589
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:42,120
所有男人的生活技能
Everything a man needs to get by.

590
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:44,260
我很高兴我这些技能能传下去
I'm just glad I have someone to pass it on to.

591
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:45,140
你有曼尼啊
You've got Manny.

592
00:18:46,820 --> 00:18:48,820
曼尼认识我的时候基本已经定型了
Manny came to me kind of fully cooked.

593
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,120
培养米奇尔的时候我还太年轻
And I was an idiot with Mitchell,

594
00:18:51,220 --> 00:18:53,320
再等这个家伙长大
and by the time this guy gets old enough,

595
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:54,520
谁知道我还能记得些什么
who knows how much I'll remember?

596
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:57,380
这些年是我传播智慧的黄金年龄
These are my prime wisdom-giving years.

597
00:18:58,060 --> 00:18:59,100
还有什么问题吗 卢克
You got any more questions, Luke?

598
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:00,480
只有一个
Just one --

599
00:19:00,820 --> 00:19:01,380
我能尝一口吗
can I have a sip?

600
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:03,100
啤酒 当然 管他呢
The beer? Sure. What the hell.

601
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:04,820
太棒了 我第一次喝啤酒
Awesome. My first drink of beer.

602
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:07,140
我记得当初我第一次给米奇尔
I remember the day I gave Mitchell

603
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:08,380
喝啤酒的情景
his first taste of beer.

604
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,400
他面部扭曲地一直喝
He winced and carried on

605
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:12,380
就好像有人在从他的腿上取出一枚子弹
like someone was digging a bullet out of his leg.

606
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:16,700
我不忍心把菲尔的那一刻夺走
I couldn't take that moment away from Phil.

607
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,340
等等 等一下
Hang on. Wait a second.

608
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:19,160
让我看一下
Let me see that.

609
00:19:20,801 --> 00:19:22,300
这啤酒不能喝了
No, this beer's skunked.

610
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:22,840
不好了
It's no good.

611
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:25,260
肯定是冰箱又出问题了
Damn fridge must be on the fritz again.

612
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:26,720
不是吧
Aw, man.

613
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:27,060
真的吗
Really?

614
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:28,240
不好意思 伙计
Sorry, buddy.

615
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,500
大概是时候打给你爸爸了 是吧
It's probably time to call your dad anyway, right?

616
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:31,100
好吧
Okay.

617
00:19:31,320 --> 00:19:31,840
等一下
Wait a second.

618
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:32,680
我想给你些东西
I want to give you something.

619
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,180
但这些是你的
But those are yours.

620
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:35,580
如果不能给外孙些工具
What's a grandfather for

621
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:37,520
那要外公有什么用呢
if he can't give his grandson a couple of tools?

622
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:38,760
谢谢 外公
Thanks, grandpa.

623
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,480
好样的
Good job!

624
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:42,700
乔
Joe...

625
00:19:43,580 --> 00:19:46,020
我知道你现在还只关心咪咪
I know you're all about the boobs right now,

626
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:48,220
但相信我
but trust me...

627
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:49,200
脖子才是重点
The neck.

628
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:53,480
别放手
Don't let go!

629
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:56,600
别担心 乔治·克鲁尼 我不会的
Don't worry, George Clooney, I won't!

630
00:19:56,860 --> 00:19:57,480
你太帅了
You're too handsome!

631
00:19:58,460 --> 00:20:01,400
注意远方太空垃圾来袭
Watch out for incoming space junk!

632
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:02,760
在哪
From where?

633
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:05,440
你的拉链开了
Your zipper's down!

634
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:05,920
真的吗
Oh, is it?

635
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:06,980
-是啊 -不好意思
- Yeah, it is. - Just... sorry.

636
00:20:06,980 --> 00:20:08,140
安迪在这里干什么
What's Andy doing here?

637
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,780
是吗 叫什么 《太空蠢货》吗
Yeah? What's it called, "Dorks in space"?

638
00:20:12,060 --> 00:20:13,940
其实挺感人的
Oh, it was actually sweet.

639
00:20:14,300 --> 00:20:15,220
真奇怪
It's weird.

640
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:16,620
他有些地方很特别
There's something about him.

641
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:17,300
你懂我意思吗
You know what I mean?

642
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:18,880
懂 他跟老爸很像
Yeah, he's just like dad.

643
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:23,360
在太空里没人能听见你叫
In space, no one can hear you scream.

644
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:24,340
什么
What?!

645
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:28,380
在太空里没人能听见你叫
In space, no one can hear you scream!

646
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:29,880
我听不到你说什么
I can't hear you!

647
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,848
在太...
In spa--

648
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:31,640
我懂了
Oh, I just got it.

649
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:33,060
这个很逗 很逗
That's good. That's good.

650
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:33,660
谢谢
Thank you.

651
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:40,300
这确实很有原创性
There's no denying it is original,

652
00:20:40,300 --> 00:20:42,200
但能看出波洛克对作者的影响
but you can see the influence of Pollock.

653
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:44,880
这个花样看似很随机
While the pattern seems haphazard and random,

654
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:47,920
但它也揭示了一种意图 一种目的
it belies a purposefulness -- a-an intentionality.

655
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:49,560
你知道吗 我觉得我看到的
You know, I think what I'm responding to

656
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:52,240
是相邻颜色的碰撞
is the clashing juxtaposition of color --

657
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:54,620
艳丽的黄和深色的背景
The bright yellow against the dark background.

658
00:20:54,820 --> 00:20:58,940
就像黑暗世界中的一抹阳光
It's like a ray of sunshine in an otherwise bleak world.

659
00:20:59,220 --> 00:21:01,080
但我不太同意
If I may take a contrary position...

660
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:03,480
我认为它代表着
...I think it speaks to the absurdity

661
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,940
人类愚蠢而枉然的尝试
and folly of human endeavor.

662
00:21:06,140 --> 00:21:08,680
就好像我们对完美的徒劳追逐
Like our futile struggle for perfection.

663
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:09,700
我知道
I get it.

664
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:10,740
我的衣服沾上了芥末酱
I got mustard on my shirt.

665
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:11,260
别说了
Get over it.

666
00:21:11,340 --> 00:21:12,260
虽然我们在开玩笑
I know we're joking,

667
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:13,240
但抛弃这点不谈
but all kidding aside,

668
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:15,060
这真的让我想起康丁斯基...
it really does remind me of Kandinsky's --
